00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:32.540
I knew boyfriend a little.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:35.640
I saw him at the bars,
and saw some of the girls

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.820
he used to bring home
while she was away.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.430
He just needed more
space to cheat.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:41.690
You can just come on in, guys.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.630
Don't even fuck with it.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.970
He just needed more
space to cheat.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:48.530
Fine, he said.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.740
But every time he went for
the door, she got to crying

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:55.580
and would be like, why
are you doing this to me?

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:58.820
They sounded a lot like me
and my old girlfriend Loretta.

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:00.410
But I swore to
myself that I would

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.980
