though every Cleopatra looking

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.830
Latina in the city made
me stop and wish she

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:08.750
would come back to me.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.570
By the time boyfriend got
himself into the hallway,

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:13.550
I was already in my apartment.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:17.420
And girlfriend, girlfriend
would not stop crying.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:18.950
Twice she tried.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:22.220
She must have heard me moving
around right above her.

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:26.660
And both times I held my breath
until she started up again.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.520
I followed her
into the bathroom,

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:32.600
