00:42:56.890 --> 00:42:58.900
We all know he's on death row.

00:42:58.900 --> 00:43:01.330
We all know that he's
an ex-Black Panther,

00:43:01.330 --> 00:43:04.690
an important
anti-police-brutality activist

00:43:04.690 --> 00:43:08.073
and a member of like--

00:43:08.073 --> 00:43:09.490
I don't know,
[? one of our-- ?] I

00:43:09.490 --> 00:43:13.280
think just someone who was very
important who was framed for--

00:43:13.280 --> 00:43:13.780
thank you.

00:43:13.780 --> 00:43:15.010
See, we've got someone
who brought it.

00:43:15.010 --> 00:43:16.600
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]
but it's here.

00:43:16.600 --> 00:43:17.767
DIAZ: I'm glad that's there.

00:43:17.767 --> 00:43:19.450
